matricies\n+ Twice as fast\n+ Stable by definition\n- Strict domain and root \
operations\n\>\"", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"l11", " ", "0", " ", "0"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{"l21", " ", "l22", " ", "0"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
